 small amplitude at slow speed as the girl points at a textbook problem and says with frustration: <d>[Chinese] 你怎么还是不明白？</d> The boy frowns and replies: <d>[Chinese] 是你讲得太快了！</d> She crosses her arms and retorts: <d>[Chinese] 你根本没认真听！</d> He turns away slightly: <d>[Chinese] 我才没有！</d>\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:06.000, the camera cuts to a medium close-up of the girl (S1). Her expression softens from anger to regret. She reaches out and touches the boy's sleeve, then says gently: <d>[Chinese] 对不起，我刚才太急了。</d> The boy (S2) turns back, his face relaxing. The camera arcs gently around them at slow speed as the girl leans in and kisses him on the cheek. He smiles, accepting the apology, and lightly touches her hand.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:11.000, the camera cuts to a medium-wide shot as both students pull back, laughing. They each grab their textbooks from the desk and raise them high into the air in celebration, matching the joyful pose, composition, and lighting of Picture 2 at the 15.00-second mark.\n\noverall_soundscape: Soft afternoon classroom ambience with distant birds outside the window. Books rustle and a pencil taps during the study moment, then tense silence falls during the argument. Fabric moves as the girl reaches out, followed by a light kiss sound and relieved laughter. Books slap against their palms as they lift them in unison.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A gentle acoustic-guitar pattern at a moderate tempo, pausing during the tense exchange, then swelling into a warm string phrase as the girl apologizes, carrying through the final joyful lift and fading out.\n", 1344, 768, 124], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 16, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 17, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 18, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "link": 19, "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "lo